{"steam_appid":4078360,"steam_name":"When We Arrive","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078360/460226275/3dae2213d7255e69c59b5b418c712f78e3dec395/1780501864/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1780502466","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257347191/1ba9b3d379de48f425b4d2ae23ffa944da6132f7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1780502466","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/f1c1a68c0680c45151cc3fd0a0666259478eb468/ss_f1c1a68c0680c45151cc3fd0a0666259478eb468.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788943795","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/4eacd4523caad43b2b5283904017a4afae4b8c8c/ss_4eacd4523caad43b2b5283904017a4afae4b8c8c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788943795","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/becd65e6f0bab71804f894faf19a8c18c163d5eb/ss_becd65e6f0bab71804f894faf19a8c18c163d5eb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788943795","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/bab5ece74df1c30c82d450821ce67f942a945435/ss_bab5ece74df1c30c82d450821ce67f942a945435.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788943795","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/49e4f5312b8804ea2f1f3e3ed2cf5e1caece3841/ss_49e4f5312b8804ea2f1f3e3ed2cf5e1caece3841.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788943795"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The god Auran has vanished. His temple lies somewhere in the mountains, far beyond the forest, the swamps and everything in between. Can you reach it and find Auran?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗺️ Journey with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the world alone or bring up to 3 friends along. Help each other out, or secretly steal your best friend's last ration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.poster.avif?t=1788943795\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.webm?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/22d1f3af17bb4fcd79ff8c98a80ccba3.mp4?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧭 The Journey Is the Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey takes you through new landscapes, unexpected events and places you missed last time. Auran's temple waits somewhere at the end. Whether you make it is another question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.poster.avif?t=1788943795\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.webm?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13ea91701eaf4e5082cac56f44b1b9fc.mp4?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💀 Survive the Dangers of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin ambushes, deadly traps, and unpredictable events will constantly put you and your friends to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.poster.avif?t=1788943795\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.webm?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/13cf2a3bb176aaaaac7ec104e72f34ae.mp4?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💎 Find Treasure and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold, equipment, rare relics. Some you'll find in chests, some in suspicious mounds, and some would have been better left where they were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.poster.avif?t=1788943795\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.webm?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/fd74831d72f11a71c0d0f15817a66e5c.mp4?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎭 Meet the Inhabitants of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with villagers, listen to their stories, or uncover clues that lead to hidden locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.poster.avif?t=1788943795\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.webm?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078360/extras/3a3e6561f3c3ef37f36a2aef378e7e13.mp4?t=1788943795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚙️ Grow stronger with every journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every failed attempt brings you more experience. New classes, abilities, equipment. And the most important question before each run: shovel or health potion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6GB) or AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Two Pixels UG"],"publishers":["Two Pixels UG"],"release_date":"Sep 9, 2026"}